OL,3,GNEWSABy-election confirmed after
OL,4,Acouncillor steps down
OL,5,
OL,6,FA by-election will be held in October
OL,7,Fafter a Leeds councillor stepped down
OL,8,Ffrom all his roles, citing "health
OL,9,Freasons" for his decision.
OL,11,FPeter Carlill was a Labour &
OL,12,FCo-operative ward councillor for
OL,13,FCalverley and Farsley, but he formally
OL,14,Fannounced his resignation earlier this
OL,15,Fweek.
OL,17,FHe had represented the area since his
OL,18,Felection in 2018 and in May was
OL,19,Fappointed as an executive board member
OL,20,Ffor transport and planning.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
