OL,3,GNEWSABy-election confirmed after
OL,4,Acouncillor steps down
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Leeds City Council spokesperson
OL,7,Fconfirmed Carlill's resignation and
OL,8,Fsaid a by-election for the vacant seat
OL,9,Fwould be held on 22 October.
